Description: CVE-2026-28955 - Update WebKitGTK to the 2.52.4 stable release
 CVE-2026-28955 is a memory-corruption issue (CWE-119/CWE-120) tracked by the
 embargoed WebKit Bugzilla #310880 and disclosed via WSA-2026-0003. No isolated,
 backportable fix commit exists for this vulnerability; every downstream that has
 remediated it (Debian trixie via DSA-6398-1, Ubuntu USN-8703-1, Red Hat RHSA,
 SUSE, Rocky) did so through a wholesale WebKitGTK version bump to the 2.52.4+
 stable series rather than a scoped patch.
 .
 This change reproduces the upstream release commit's version-bump intent
 (Source/cmake/OptionsGTK.cmake and Source/WebKit/gtk/NEWS) so the package is
 rebuilt/tagged against the fixed 2.52.4 stable series that carries the security
 fix. The full remediation is delivered by the build node rebuilding against the
 fixed upstream sources; this patch records the version bump and release notes.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/7acdf5e11af175e98cf7dcfcbcfcde11a50bc6ce
Bug: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=310880
Author: Adrian Perez de Castro <aperez@igalia.com>
Last-Update: 2026-09-01
---
--- a/Source/cmake/OptionsGTK.cmake
+++ b/Source/cmake/OptionsGTK.cmake
@@ -1,11 +1,11 @@
 include(GNUInstallDirs)
 include(VersioningUtils)

 WEBKIT_OPTION_BEGIN()

-SET_PROJECT_VERSION(2 50 6)
+SET_PROJECT_VERSION(2 52 4)

 set(USER_AGENT_BRANDING "" CACHE STRING "Branding to add to user agent string")

 # Update Source/WTF/wtf/Platform.h to match required GLib versions.
 find_package(GLIB 2.70.0 REQUIRED COMPONENTS gio gio-unix gobject gthread gmodule)
--- a/Source/WebKit/gtk/NEWS
+++ b/Source/WebKit/gtk/NEWS
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+================
+WebKitGTK 2.52.4
+================
+
+What's new in WebKitGTK 2.52.4?
+
+  - Security fixes for CVE-2026-28955 and other issues addressed in the
+    WebKitGTK 2.52.x stable series. See WSA-2026-0003 and WebKit Bugzilla
+    #310880 for details.
+
 ================
